      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking back through the history, it looks like this was originally introduced in ag/4508899, which was just to set up layout lib using Skia to begin with. It seems like there might be a perf regression, though if it\u0027s incompatible, that seems more important. Would it make sense to optionally turn it on? Or to use -march\u003dnative?",
